"""Pillar Coordinator - 5-Pillar Strategy Architecture

This module coordinates all 5 pillars of the strategy architecture:
1. Signal Generation
2. Market Regime Detection
3. Risk Management
4. Execution Intent
5. Performance Analytics

Author: Vincent S. Pereira
Version: 1.0.0
"""

